OL,3,GNEWSA'The change isn't talked about' -
OL,4,Athe walking group helping mums
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum who set up a walking group after
OL,7,Fexperiencing postpartum depression said
OL,8,Fshe never wanted others to feel how she
OL,9,Ffelt.
OL,11,FRachel Fearnley, 34, struggled with her
OL,12,Fmental health for three years following
OL,13,Fthe birth of her daughter in 2023.
OL,15,FAfter experiencing a miscarriage before
OL,16,Ffalling pregnant with her daughter,
OL,17,FRachel, from Aspull, said she wanted
OL,18,Fnothing more than to have a baby.
OL,20,FBut she said she felt guilty for not
OL,21,Ffeeling an instant connection after
OL,22,Fgiving birth.
